    ],
    "text": "calculating subsequent point win probabilities during a match, that also eliminates the effect of the serve side advantage. The resulting momentum difference aligns seamlessly with real-world The significance of momentum is confirmed through a K-S test, rejecting the observations. hypothesis that in-match performance is inconsequential. Further analysis involves applying the Fourier Series Fitting (FSF) model to track momentum trend."
  },
