      "p0001-n0011-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "The paper extends its analysis to dynamic strategic choices made by tennis players during matches, employing the Mixed-Strategy Nash Equilibrium model. K-means clustering is utilized to determine strategic clusters. The Nash equilibrium is calculated, offering insights into optimal strategy combinations against different opponents."
  },
